    {"inputs": {"i": 1, "f": 50, "c": 0.0047}, "expect": {"dv": 2.127659574468085}, "ref": "hand (independent script): full-wave, dV = I / (m * f * C) = 1 / (2 * 50 * 0.0047) = 2.127659574 V"},
